{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-12","kind":"proposition","title":"三直线求别作一线相与为断比例","englishTitle":"To three given straight lines to find a fourth proportional.","book":6,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","contentId":"euclid-6-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acf5bbf6ab5bd3eef3d098a23500446d356f9a02f8e9bf5951844a818a18e1b4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-12.statement","euclid-6-12.construction.1","euclid-6-12.construction.2","euclid-6-12.proof.1","euclid-6-12.proof.2","euclid-6-12.conclusion","euclid-6-12.historical.1","euclid-6-12.historical.2","euclid-6-12.historical.3","euclid-6-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2e0ec07af5bd1e45f10ba3d0496962d075b5a36e21293c21f81a571ebdb9e80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To three given straight lines to find a fourth proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三个直线 找到第四比例项"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线求别作一线相与为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"寻找三条直线：一起绘制直线以确定分割比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"feef2ca722a103c560dbdc1c620cc23f21c4893d74778082bd8b98c591de058e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the three given straight lines; thus it is required to find a fourth proportional to A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"330,B,C是三条直线;因此,需要找到一条第四比例项至A,B,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4c03df62b46990f28f1194369787914f7d5a11da3c13cc87ef9f9bf874e99a9","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two straight lines DE, DF be set out containing any angle EDF; let DG be made equal to A, GE equal to B, and further DH equal to C; let GH be joined, and let EF be drawn through E parallel to it. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将DE、DF两条直线设置为EDF角;DG直线设定为A、GE等于B,DH等于C;GH连接为GH,EF线设定为E平行线。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ceea3bdb6e7c451e8a641de8e9a0c35fe84c9de4d252b5997663c56ce8ffb53d","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, GH has been drawn parallel to EF, one of the sides of the triangle DEF, therefore, as DG is to GE, so is DH to HF. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,GH三角形DEF侧的EF平行点,DG对GE的比例等于DH对HF的比例；DG 与 GE 之比等于 DH 与 HF 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ed4075907f87d9217a2750d6d480d3997bc8663c02298e222aacbd600a067e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DG is equal to A, GE to B, and DH to C; therefore, as A is to B, so is C to HF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DG等于A,GE至B,DH至C;因此,A至B的比等于C至HF的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 HF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb0ee2d55008831b392f15aa4431e5a9142d59f4848ecbffe057e0a161d5cdd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to the three given straight lines A, B, C a fourth proportional HF has been found. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的三条直线A、B、C和第四比例项 HF上方已找到。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89712316cddce830707bf85a49bb120a7830d297d157035659e43eee8270679d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线求别作一线相与为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"寻找三条直线：一起绘制直线以确定分割比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1939ad10e19bebd21350439b67c172d392fd1055298e014277b62ab76e489015","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙乙丙甲丁三直线求别作一线相与为断比例者谓甲丁与他线之比例若甲乙与乙丙也先以甲乙乙丙作直线为甲丙次以甲丁线合甲丙任作甲角次作丁乙线相聨次从丙作丙戊线与丁乙平行末自甲丁引之遇丙戊于戊即丁戊为所求线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：甲乙乙丙甲丁 对于三条直线，先分别画出直线，然后将它们组合形成线段比例。甲丁 与其他直线之间的比例称为 甲丁。如果从 甲乙乙丙 作为直线 甲丙 的起点先画出 甲乙 和 乙丙，然后将 甲丁 与 甲丙 组合成角 甲，再与 丁乙 连接成直线。接下来，从 丙 画出 丙戊 与 丁乙 平行。在 甲丁 末端，在 戊 处画出 丙戊，即 丁戊 为所需直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"603799daceef5887b265a5011fab6f515f9f5f869dc2caacc79c59ae42238fe4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙戊角形内之丁乙线既与丙戊边平行即甲丁与丁戊之比例若甲乙与乙丙〈本篇二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：三角形内的直线 丁乙 :甲丙戊 与边 丙戊 平行，即 甲丁 与 丁戊 的比例，如果 甲乙 和 乙丙〈本篇二〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-12.source","contentId":"euclid-6-12","revisionId":"euclid-6-12@raw-acf5bbf6ab5bd3ee","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ac4d5f592b1df58a1ca507e367458853c3c91e54d3de576f4c23367803e5797","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/re